      $en${"title":"Gyeonghwa Station Rail Trail Photo Walk","description":"A demo photo walk observing the winter scenery along the old railway.","detail_description":"A winter photo walk around the park rail trail, using the Gyeonghwa Station Park parking address as a demo meeting reference. The December schedule does not promise cherry blossoms. No guide assignment, photography lesson, or operating agreement with the venue is included.","inclusions":["Demo setup: route guidance and a sample itinerary"],"preparation_items":["Suggested for the demo: comfortable walking shoes","Suggested for the demo: personal water and clothing suitable for the season"],"precautions":["All schedules, fees, capacities, and inclusions are development demo settings; they do not indicate actual bookings or operating agreements with venues.","This is a winter demo schedule; it does not advertise cherry blossoms in bloom.","Use only open walking areas and follow current site guidance."],"review_status":"DRAFT"}$en$::jsonb,
      $ja${"title":"慶和駅の線路沿い写真散歩","description":"冬の旧線路の風景を観察するデモ用フォト散策です。","detail_description":"慶和駅公園の駐車場住所をデモ用集合場所の目安にした、公園の線路沿いを歩く冬の写真散策です。12月の日程で桜の開花を案内するものではありません。ガイドの手配、撮影レッスン、施設との運営契約はありません。","inclusions":["デモ設定：ルート案内と日程表の例"],"preparation_items":["デモの推奨持ち物：歩きやすい靴","デモの推奨持ち物：飲み水と季節に合った服装"],"precautions":["日程、参加費、定員、提供内容はすべて開発用デモ設定です。実際の予約や施設との運営契約を示すものではありません。","冬のデモ日程のため、桜の開花時期として案内しません。","安全に開放されている散策エリアのみ利用し、現地の案内に従ってください。"],"review_status":"DRAFT"}$ja$::jsonb),
